Z||000011||Ditz88GT||06-11-2001||06:10 PM||||84Bill,<P>The CD sounds like a great idea!  I'd really like to check out the video of the drive to the show...man what a rush.  It was so cool, at one point when, I was in the back, it looked like Fieros as far as I could see.<P>Ditz88GT<BR> <A HREF="http://go.to/fiero" TARGET=_blank>http://go.to/fiero</A> ||||reg||14
Z||000012||skitime||06-11-2001||06:33 PM||||I agree with that only in reverse.  I was constantly looking in the rear view mirror and thought what an awesome sight.  Fieros as far as I could see.  It was really special when going around the turns and seeing the cars slightly from the side. Maybe we should just plan on another breakfast and just drive around the country side.  I know some awesome back country roads around here.||||reg||1
Z||000013||84Bill||06-11-2001||06:59 PM||||Well I have to tell you it was very cool from the middle! got them in the front and rear! The back is the best place to be for pictures. Like Ski said when you go around corners and up and down hills it's just so damn cool! <BR>||||reg||1
Z||000014||Frank Sombers||06-11-2001||10:06 PM||||First of all a big THANK YOU to Dave for his efforts in getting things organized and for all of the pictures.<BR>I enjoyed meeting other Fieroholics and seeing their cars. Also, it was nice to place faces with the names from the forum. <BR>A Lancaster County ride (maybe in the fall)sounds like a great idea! Perhaps a tour through some of the covered bridges of Lancaster County (with a possible picnic and photo shoots) would generate some interest.<BR>Again, thanks to everyone for a very enjoyable day. <BR>Hope to see you all at Zinn's.<BR>Frank<BR>||||reg||14
Z||000015||Fierochic88||06-11-2001||10:12 PM||||All of these ideas sound wonderful!  Don't forget about the MAFOA show at Zinn's on August 18.  I'm in the process of organizing a road rally from there as well so that will allow you and your navigator to see some of the lovely Lancaster County Countryside.<P>Jennifer<BR>Silver 88 GT<BR>Silver 86 CP<BR>Cobalt Blue 85 GT||||reg||1
Z||000016||skitime||06-11-2001||10:26 PM||||I hate to say it but we might be away on vacation for during that time period.  The worst of it is that the Zinns show is in our backyard so to speak. Jennifer if you want to cruise sometime on the back roads of Lancaster/Berks counties for ideas for the road rally, lets set up a day to do it and make a mini event like Saturday was. We could start with breakfast again and end somewhere for lunch or a barbecue.  ||||reg||1
